{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "G4 unified input \u2014 the AXIS FOLD and the EDGE LAW (dsx-game.md \u00a72 G4). digital[]: a 4-key set folds to a vector with +y UP and +x RIGHT; a diagonal normalizes to length 1; opposing keys cancel. analog[]: a raw stick pair (raw y is DOWN-positive, so y is negated) with the deadzone applied RADIALLY then rescaled so the live range stays 0..1; magnitude never exceeds 1. combined[]: an analog stick past its deadzone WINS over the digital keys, otherwise the keys apply; keys and a declared dpad union per direction. frames[]: a pinned device-event stream folded frame by frame \u2014 an event fires ONCE on the transition to pressed, never per frame, and a momentary touch word is pressed for exactly the frame it arrives in.",
